races Dealer"},{"id":3063007,"name":"Claude Badolle","role":"Ragman"},{"id":1102256,"name":"Max Martel","role":"Drunken Man"},{"id":25963,"name":"Nicolas Bataille","role":"Working Man","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1aWgQsTdl33NyRm2glUBnoPa3bg.jpg"},{"id":548816,"name":"Pierre Étaix","role":"Delivery man / Telegraph operator (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w6GihDVBzsk0tpAMHcWPoUCyRu3.jpg"},{"id":582274,"name":"Jean-Claude Rémoleux","role":"Client in Monsieur Arpel's Factory (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7q969M9xEP18hWjnx7fbNqRQ3DC.jpg"},{"id":40539,"name":"Denise Péronne","role":"Mademoiselle Fevrier (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aDgBFquqXntnvjDglwoRxrEzffC.jpg"},{"id":3422930,"name":"Nicole Regnault","role":"Short-sighted motorist (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g6tVOMnj0VqfBbYQKkh6kXYPvMj.jpg"},{"id":1004632,"name":"Édouard Francomme","role":"House Painter (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jNiEjMwox5tPTpjFtXSTHzqYrfd.jpg"},{"id":44225,"name":"André Dino","role":"Sweeper (uncredited)"},{"id":3406841,"name":"René Lord","role":"(uncredited)"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Mio zio","overview":"Mentre l'imperturbabile monsieur Hulot continua ad abitare in un pittoresco e caloroso quartiere popolare, sua sorella ha sposato il dirigente di una fabbrica di oggetti in plastica; la coppia ha un figlioletto, Gérard, che cresce in una casa ipertecnologica e zeppa di ogni moderna diavoleria. Gli sforzi dei parenti per adattare Hulot al loro stile di vita hanno esiti fallimentari: anzi, è proprio Gérard a dimostrarsi affascinato dallo scombinato e confusionario zio..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Mon Oncle","overview":"Genial, bumbling Monsieur Hulot loves his top-floor apartment in a grimy corner of the city, and cannot fathom why his sister's family has moved to the suburbs. Their house is an ultra-modern nightmare, which Hulot only visits for the sake of stealing away his rambunctious young nephew. Hulot's sister, however, wants to win him over to her new way of life, and conspires to set him up with a wife and job.","tagline":"Mr Hulot takes a precious, playful and purely premeditated look at modern times..."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Monsieur Arpel est féru de modernisme. Directeur d'une fabrique de tuyaux en plastique, il a doté sa maison de tous les perfectionnements techniques possibles à ce jour. Pourtant, cette maison pourvue de robots est loin d'apporter une atmosphère détendue à son fils, Gérard, 10 ans. Le beau-frère de monsieur Arpel, monsieur Hulot, fantasque et bohème, occupe un modeste deux pièces dans un quartier populaire. Il invite de temps à autre son jeune neveu, dressé à l'ordre rigoureux qui règne chez lui, à découvrir son domaine de fantaisie et de liberté. Sa sœur, maintenant madame Arpel, espère secrètement qu'il épousera sa voisine, mais c'est compter sans l'esprit discrètement récalcitrant et frondeur de Hulot, résolument épris de liberté...","tagline":"Monsieur Hulot porte un regard précieux, ludique… et prémonitoire sur les temps modernes…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4czpGiC51CCqsAPmDcjjfFJLY2k.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3yYNJeR6JynSE3Y1AfVIJQ6g3UX.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":427,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4czpGiC51CCqsAPmDcjjfFJLY2k.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4czpGiC51CCqsAPmDcjjfFJLY2k.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4czpGiC51CCqsAPmDcjjfFJLY2k.jpg","pre